        "attribution": "These names represent the foundational concept and major experimental development, though many groups have advanced the field.",
        "maturity": "The acceleration principle is established, but reliable, high-quality beams and broad scientific use remain active challenges.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The Nobel-scale impact will depend on whether the technique becomes a dependable accelerator platform or enables a distinctive discovery."
        ]
      }
    }
